        "created_at": "2014-09-08T19:03:12.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>A target entering play is entering a hex and therefore triggers hazard terrain. &nbsp;Unity can get locked down pretty well this way. &nbsp; Luther answered a similar one in another thread that had a list of questions.</p>",
